<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SKUKAUSKAS SCORES FIRST WORLD CUP QUALIFIER TRY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SKUKAUSKAS SCORES FIRST WORLD CUP QUALIFIER TRY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian centre Guntars Skukauskas had the honour of scoring the first try in the 1999 World Cup qualifiers on Saturday as his team beat Norway 44-6 in Riga.</p>
<p>The Europe Pool Two first round match was the first of 138 qualifiers for the Cup to be staged in Wales and England.</p>
</text>
